{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04481","headline":"宿空舲峡青树邨浦 · 陈子昂","name":"宿空舲峡青树邨浦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"的的明月水，啾啾寒夜猿。\n客思浩方乱，洲浦寂无喧。\n忆作千金子，宁知九逝魂。\n虚闻事朱阙，结绶骛华轩。\n委别高堂爱，窥觎明主恩。\n今成转蓬去，叹息复何言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}